      "start_date_to": null,
      "start_date_from": null,
      "start_date_sort": null,
      "zotero_refs": "[Z5FZQCNC]: 141-142. Lineage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) according to the Fifth Dalai Lama: from \u015a\u0101kya\u015br\u012bbhadra (ID:6418), Sugata\u015br\u012b (ID:6616), D\u0101na\u015b\u012bla (ID:6032), and Sa\u1e45gha\u015br\u012b (ID:6617), to Sa paN (ID:3892). Then to 'U yug pa Rig[s] pa'i seng ge (ID:3846), Zhang mDo sde dpal (ID:6624), 'Jam skya Nam mkha' dpal (ID:6621), dPang lo tsA ba Blo gros brtan pa (ID:4097), etc. \r\n\r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 142. Lineage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) according to\u202fNgag dbang chos grags (ID:6897): from Kha che paN chen (ID:6418) to Sa paN (ID:3892). Then from Sa paN it goes directly to Lho pa kun mkhyen (ID:5463), 'U yug pa (ID:3846), and Zhang mDo sde dpal (ID:6624). Then from the latter to 'Jam dbyangs skya bo (ID:6621), then to dPang lo tsA ba (ID:4097), etc. \r\n\r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 142-143. Lineage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) according to\u202fTsong kha pa (ID:5636): from \u015a\u0101kya\u015br\u012bbhadra (ID:6418) to Sa paN (ID:3892), then to Rigs seng (i.e., 'U yug pa Rigs pa'i seng ge (ID:3846), the lineage is then suddenly discontinued. \r\n\r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 142-143. Lineage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) according to\u202fmKhas grub rje (ID:6470): from Kha che PaN chen (ID:6418) to Chos rje Sa paN (ID:3892). Then to 'U yug pa Rigs pa'i seng ge (ID:3846), lTe ra ba Chos grags (ID:6828), Byang chub dpal (ID:6829), mKhan po dBang phyug dpal (ID:4320), Nya dbon Kun dga' dpal (ID:6741), rJe btsun Red mda' ba (ID:6756), etc. \r\n\r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 143. Lineage of exposition (bshad pa) of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) as received by\u202fBu ston (ID:5999): from PaN chen \u015a\u0101kya\u015br\u012b (ID:6418), Chos rje Sa skya pa (ID:3892), 'U yug pa bSod seng (ID:3846), Khang sten 'Od zer rgyal mtshan (ID:7647), Slob dpon Tshad ma pa (i.e., Tshad ma\u2019i skyes bu bSod nams mgon (ID:6925), Bu ston (ID:5999). \r\n\r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 143-144. Lineage of the reading transmission (lung) of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) as received by Bu ston (ID:5999): from rNgog lo tsA ba (ID:3786) to Khyung Rin chen grags (ID:3809), rGya dmar Byang chub grags (ID:3834), Phywa ba (ID:3831), gTsang nag pa (ID:3839), Dar ma bkra shis (ID:6217), gNyal pa (i.e., gNyal zhig \u2018Jam pa\u2019i rdo rje (ID:3887), Bo dong pa (probably (ID:3904), lDong pa Grags pa dpal, Lho pa Grub seng (ID:7651), Tshad ma'i skyes bu (ID:6925), Bu ston (ID:5999). \r\n\r\n[Z5FZQCNC]: 144. Lineage of the Pram\u0101\u1e47av\u0101rttika (ID:3772) according to 'Gos lo tsA ba (ID:5839): Kha che PaN chen \u015a\u0101kya\u015br\u012b (ID:6418), Sa paN (ID:3892), 'U yug pa (ID:3846), Zhang btsun mDo sde dpal (ID:6624), 'Jam dbyangs skya bo (ID:6621), dPal ldan pa, 'Jam dbyangs sTon gzhon (ID:5942), Nor bzangs dpal (ID:6604), etc.",
